            "value": "Backups contain conversations, configuration, and local request records, but no API keys. Store backups securely. Restoring creates a separate directory and preserves the current library."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份包含对话、配置和本地请求记录，不含 API Key。请妥善保存备份文件。恢复会创建新的隔离目录，保留当前资料库。"
          }
        }
      }
